 "Giusto: l’attrito tira indietro quanto tiri tu, finché ce la fa. Il tratteggio dice fin dove arriva.": "Right: friction pulls back as much as you pull, as long as it can. The dashed line shows how far it can go.",
 "Esatto: l’attrito statico si adatta al tiro, fino a un valore massimo (la tacca in fondo al tratteggio). Superato quello, la cassa parte.": "Exactly: static friction adjusts to the pull, up to a maximum value (the notch at the end of the dashed line). Beyond that, the crate starts moving.",
 "Esatto: da ferma, l’attrito trattiene quanto serve, né più né meno, fino a un massimo. Oltre, la cassa parte.": "Exactly: at rest, friction holds back just as much as needed, no more, no less, up to a maximum. Beyond that, the crate starts moving.",
 "Fai un lancio con un tiro piccolo e confronta la freccia rossa con quella bianca.": "Do a launch with a small pull and compare the red arrow with the white one.",
